Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,ー＝＝＝＝＝　Ａパート　＝＝＝＝＝－
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.16,0:00:14.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,唉…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.94,0:00:15.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fs36}讨厌 才没有啦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.16,0:00:20.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fs39}真的啦 你胸部绝对变大了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.68,0:00:20.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去死
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.39,0:00:22.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fs39}哎呀 你真恶心 不过…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.08,0:00:26.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去死 去死去死…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.45,0:00:30.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别再把你们的隐性基因遗传给后代了 发情期的淫兽们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.29,0:00:31.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去死…去死…去死…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.56,0:00:34.52,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,诶? 呐 这是build-builder吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.62,0:00:37.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,才不是 女人真的是头脑简单
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.93,0:00:42.22,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,是么 但是很像啊 嘴唇这么厚
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.39,0:00:46.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样就像的话 那个教算盘的大叔不也是build-builder…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.70,0:00:50.62,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯… 可是 仁太
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.97,0:00:52.38,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,啊？仁太？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.96,0:00:56.95,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,仁太？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.20,0:01:02.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,夏天的野兽 相当地凶猛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.98,0:01:06.85,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,啊 太狡猾了 芽芽也要吃椒盐拉面
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.81,0:01:13.32,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,啊 鸡蛋 芽芽喜欢蛋花 蛋花
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.49,0:01:22.09,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,喂 鸡蛋要结块了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.30,0:01:27.51,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,把鸡蛋搅开 搅开 搅开~
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.00,0:01:28.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fs36}噢 在做什么？拉面？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.53,0:01:31.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fs36}不错嘛 仁太 给我也做一份吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.12,0:01:32.27,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,啊 叔叔 打扰啦~
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.86,0:01:35.65,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,仁太？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.05,0:01:37.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.54,0:01:39.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fs36}太好了 真可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.54,0:01:41.61,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么给叔叔做 不给我做呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.69,0:01:42.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你那看到什么都说 “可爱”的口头禅 也该改改了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.14,0:01:46.67,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,…芽芽也被说可爱呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.14,0:01:46.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啊？不是挺好的词嘛 什么情况都能用
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.96,0:01:48.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一般才不用呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.00,0:01:49.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鸡蛋呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.96,0:01:52.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,打一个上去 不要弄碎了哟
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.19,0:01:53.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,OK
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.19,0:01:54.62,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,啊 叔叔都有
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.62,0:01:57.48,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,偏心 偏心 你偏心叔叔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.14,0:01:59.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,果然
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.33,0:02:01.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看电视看电视
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.29,0:02:04.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啊 猫咪真可爱~
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.19,0:02:06.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老爸和平时完全没什么两样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.44,0:02:08.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也就是说  果然…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.34,0:02:10.73,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,喂 仁太
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.87,0:02:12.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.25,0:02:16.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我开动了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.02,0:02:20.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,加点胡椒粉 胡椒粉 胡椒粉 胡椒粉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.31,0:02:21.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.84,0:02:23.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.15,0:02:25.87,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,芽芽也要吃！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.28,0:02:26.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,仁太？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.56,0:02:28.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啊 没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.22,0:02:30.96,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,筷子 筷子呢？！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.34,0:02:33.02,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,我要筷子！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.65,0:02:35.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕…啊 啊啊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.42,0:02:42.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啊？什么？怎么了？在家里中暑了？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.75,0:02:44.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可爱是可爱  但是糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.04,0:02:46.08,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,仁太？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.88,0:02:49.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那时候的夏天…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.44,0:02:58.97,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}仁太 危险哟
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.97,0:02:59.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.18,0:03:07.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}啊 还是仁太抓的最大
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.16,0:03:08.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}嘿嘿  是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.56,0:03:09.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}嘁
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.74,0:03:11.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真的呢 好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.09,0:03:14.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}仁太 好帅啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.13,0:03:15.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}嘿嘿嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.16,0:03:17.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那时候的我…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.42,0:03:18.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}喂 鹤子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.90,0:03:19.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怎么？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.42,0:03:20.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}喂 仁太
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.59,0:03:24.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}嗯？怎么了 芽芽
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.37,0:03:30.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那个
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.78,0:03:34.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}想拜托你一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.95,0:05:10.90,Title,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs30\move(1110,471,1110,643,513,925)}仁太：\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\N我去工作喽！\N好好休息！\h\h\h\h
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.39,0:05:15.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是…什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.38,0:05:22.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我生病了 一定是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.91,0:05:25.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这肯定是一直以来承受的巨大压力
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.94,0:05:30.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和精神创伤 由于夏日的酷暑 变成了实体…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.30,0:05:35.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且 青春期的性冲动也来凑热闹…么…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.46,0:05:43.72,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,早上好 仁太
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.72,0:05:44.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,假如
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.87,0:05:50.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你只是作为我心理压力的实体化 出现在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.53,0:05:50.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.93,0:05:51.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.25,0:05:54.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么现在才出现
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.94,0:05:56.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.61,0:06:00.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还是以长大后的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.72,0:06:07.79,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,唔… 这个 你问我的话… 我也不知道的说
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.96,0:06:09.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.27,0:06:14.75,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,不过呢 也许 是想让你帮我实现愿望吧 芽芽
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.52,0:06:18.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,愿望？那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.06,0:06:23.49,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,那个… 我也不知道的说
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.53,0:06:27.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,连愿望都不知道是什么怎么帮你实现啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.29,0:06:30.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 话虽这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.34,0:06:33.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到底愿望是什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.56,0:06:34.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么知道！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.77,0:06:37.41,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,口水喷到脸上了 恶心死了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.61,0:06:38.86,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,防护盾
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.41,0:06:45.04,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fs36}这样我就无敌了哟 芽芽 无敌了~
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.64,0:06:41.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙就是夏天的猛兽
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.88,0:06:45.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的心理压力 我的精神创伤
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.36,0:06:48.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总之 先记起那个愿望到底是什么吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.24,0:06:51.13,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,啊 对了对了 那个是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.51,0:06:53.88,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,大家一起才能实现的愿望
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.60,0:06:56.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大 大家…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.71,0:06:59.09,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,来了~
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.09,0:07:00.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.04,0:07:01.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,叫你等等
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.88,0:07:03.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是你听嘛 有人在按门铃
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.89,0:07:07.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你去开门怎么行呀 好了别闹了…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.91,0:07:11.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.56,0:07:14.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,安城
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.11,0:07:16.02,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,啊 是小鸣~
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.02,0:07:17.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂 冷静点
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.20,0:07:20.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,冷静？我又不焦躁
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.25,0:07:24.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啊 没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.48,0:07:26.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么觉得肩膀好沉好沉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.59,0:07:32.54,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,小鸣 你看不到芽芽吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.08,0:07:36.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你来干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.20,0:07:38.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给你这个
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.53,0:07:39.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.54,0:07:43.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师拜托我拿给你的暑假作业
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.16,0:07:46.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在才给我？暑假可是就只剩两天…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.27,0:07:50.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我和宿海你不一样 我可是很忙的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.82,0:07:54.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那样的话 这种东西随便丢掉不就好了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.87,0:07:57.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,反正那种垃圾高中 我也不想去上了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.80,0:08:00.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然宿海你来不来都无所谓
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.61,0:08:04.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是 你也太不像话了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.83,0:08:13.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.56,0:08:34.03,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,仁太你这个笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.31,0:08:35.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,痛 痛…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.40,0:08:38.19,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么不拜托小鸣呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.37,0:08:42.38,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,对她说“和我一起实现愿望吧 小鸣！”
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.45,0:08:44.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,先跟你说好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.03,0:08:44.44,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.05,0:08:51.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fs30}注：鸣子的昵称“あなる”音同“肛门”(アナル)，很不雅。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.05,0:08:48.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要叫那家伙…“小鸣”
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.08,0:08:51.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,安城或者鸣子 叫哪个都行…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.40,0:08:53.95,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么？小鸣就是小鸣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.38,0:08:58.76,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,对大家都很温柔 有好多好多游戏和漫画…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.90,0:08:59.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.34,0:09:04.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙 已经不是那个时候的小鸣了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.01,0:09:05.47,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.11,0:09:09.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就算拜托那个臭婊子 她也不会帮忙的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.58,0:09:10.68,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,臭婊子？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.23,0:09:12.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是笨女人的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.01,0:09:15.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总之 那家伙已经不是我的朋友了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.48,0:09:16.41,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,别说了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.65,0:09:22.65,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,我讨厌说小鸣坏话的仁太
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.31,0:09:24.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,芽芽…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.41,0:09:27.88,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,呐 再去找一次小鸣吧 去拜托她吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.19,0:09:29.36,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3} 仁太！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.41,0:09:33.15,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,仁太？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.72,0:09:34.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.30,0:09:39.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去告诉安城那个愿望的话 你就会知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.54,0:09:41.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不光是安城
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.57,0:09:45.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所有的一切 都和那时候不一样了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.31,0:09:53.81,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,喂 仁太 还没好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.43,0:09:55.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来了来了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.07,0:10:02.75,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,帽子和眼镜？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.06,0:10:03.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别在意
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.77,0:10:05.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.16,0:10:06.75,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.19,0:10:07.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.16,0:10:10.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啊 去买东西？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.24,0:10:12.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是呀 对了 说起来…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.93,0:10:14.86,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,仁太？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.22,0:10:16.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.31,0:10:27.07,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.07,0:10:28.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你 你们好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.09,0:10:30.15,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,奇怪的表情
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.42,0:10:32.99,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,啊 牙齿上粘着拉面里的葱哟
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.13,0:10:33.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,烦死了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.55,0:10:40.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.17,0:10:46.84,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,等等我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.00,0:10:52.72,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,呐 小鸣的家 不在这边啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.83,0:10:55.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,顺便散个步
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.35,0:11:00.54,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,这里以前是BOMBOM
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.92,0:11:04.00,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,现在变成了WcDonald  好棒
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.22,0:11:05.32,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,但是 芽芽…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.18,0:11:07.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,初中同校的人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.00,0:11:07.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fs36}你看了那部电影么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.46,0:11:07.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fs36}哪部？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.29,0:11:12.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fs36}就是那个 外星人出现了 然后一个用双截棍的姐姐在学校里和它们战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.70,0:11:14.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\f36}哎？ 那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.41,0:11:17.51,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,你朋友？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.18,0:11:20.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.32,0:11:22.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也是呀
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.43,0:11:27.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然被那些欧巴桑弄得有些失常 但其实没人会在意我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.75,0:11:33.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,安城不也说了么 我这种人 随便怎样都无所谓
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.15,0:11:35.29,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,身首异~处
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.96,0:11:42.01,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,夏天的味道~
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.30,0:11:44.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你倒是一点都没变呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.74,0:11:45.34,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.38,0:11:47.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.59,0:11:50.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然啦 她不过是幻觉而已
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.35,0:11:56.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,“帮我实现愿望吧”么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.27,0:12:00.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,果然 这肯定是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.19,0:12:03.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我对芽芽的…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.62,0:12:07.83,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,仁太 看我看我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.82,0:12:11.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在干嘛呀 很危险诶
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.02,0:12:16.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}仁太！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.10,0:12:18.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.45,0:12:21.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}仁太！ 小芽芽她…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.96,0:12:40.96,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,仁…仁太？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.80,0:12:43.94,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.69,0:12:46.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没…没事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.51,0:12:50.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,痛…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.68,0:12:51.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,宿海？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.65,0:12:57.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.83,0:13:02.79,Title,,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(684,383)}超\N和\N平
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.83,0:13:02.79,Title,,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(684,530)}{\frz270}Busters
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.83,0:13:02.79,Title,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs45\c&HB7C534&\pos(643,521)}✿
Dialogue: 1,0:12:59.83,0:13:02.79,Title,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs150\c&HB7C534&\pos(640,485)}.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:59.83,0:13:02.79,Title,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs70\pos(652,540)}.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.83,0:13:02.79,Title,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs35\pos(652,557)\frx44\fry320\c&H14191F&}✿
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.83,0:13:02.79,Title,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs16\frz90\fscx120\pos(714,450)}♣○
Dialogue: 1,0:12:59.83,0:13:02.79,Title,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs120\frz90\pos(688,446)\c&HFDFDFD&}.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:59.83,0:13:02.79,Title,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs20\frz90\pos(719,463)\clip(m 694 421 l 746 460 736 499)}○
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,ー＝＝＝＝＝　Ｂパート　＝＝＝＝＝－
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.03,0:13:10.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂 鸣子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.22,0:13:12.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你去了小仁家吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.90,0:13:13.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,先敲门！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.91,0:13:15.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啊 我没敲吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.76,0:13:17.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀算了啦 说起来…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.26,0:13:18.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只是去晃了一圈
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.10,0:13:20.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再说 和妈妈你没关系吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.23,0:13:21.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有关系哟
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.59,0:13:25.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,本来想让你帮我把馒头带过去的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.75,0:13:27.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你自己送过去不就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.63,0:13:29.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦哦 青春期青春期
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.86,0:13:32.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.84,0:13:37.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实不像话的…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.48,0:13:40.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我才对
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.13,0:13:42.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.19,0:13:47.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.37,0:13:50.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,刚上完暑假补习班回来 毕竟是高升学率的重点高中呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.02,0:13:53.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs36\an8}说起来 你…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.57,0:13:54.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,本来我也应该穿着的 高中的校服
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.02,0:13:56.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.25,0:13:57.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,宿海？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.92,0:13:59.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.28,0:14:02.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.10,0:14:10.86,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,是雪热和鹤子呢~
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.83,0:14:13.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.72,0:14:16.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是 是芽芽
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.86,0:14:19.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啊 不是 那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.60,0:14:20.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,芽芽 是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.69,0:14:22.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啊 那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.11,0:14:25.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事到如今 你还在说那种话么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.90,0:14:29.03,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,雪热？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.48,0:14:30.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我听说了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.33,0:14:31.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,雪热！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.57,0:14:34.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没在上学的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.98,0:14:39.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,中考失利后 上了这附近的三流高中
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.63,0:14:43.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在却不去上学 还叫着本间芽衣子的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.15,0:14:46.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你脑袋是不是有问题？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.23,0:14:50.88,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,仁太！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.54,0:14:54.10,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,雪热你这个大笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.20,0:14:56.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.06,0:15:00.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,唉…干嘛这么激动
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.98,0:15:04.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一说到本间芽衣子 就变了个人似地
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.74,0:15:08.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不也是这样么 松雪君
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.31,0:15:11.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多话
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.02,0:15:15.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没同情心的家伙 只有脸还长的不错
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.89,0:15:16.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还很聪明不是么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.61,0:15:18.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.09,0:15:23.86,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,仁太
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.34,0:15:26.14,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.44,0:15:30.10,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,仁太
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.45,0:15:37.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这下你总算明白了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.34,0:15:40.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家都变了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.65,0:15:44.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 变化最大的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.53,0:15:47.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我…吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.62,0:15:48.16,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,仁太？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.58,0:15:50.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的心里阴影
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.54,0:15:54.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,差不多该放过我了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.08,0:15:56.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟你在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.84,0:16:00.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总会让我…让我想起讨厌的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.40,0:16:03.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我很焦躁
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.86,0:16:11.43,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,仁…太…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.43,0:16:22.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那时候
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.35,0:16:24.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那时候的夏天
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.90,0:16:26.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.18,0:16:34.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}喂喂 决定了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.89,0:16:36.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}决定什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.32,0:16:39.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们是 超和平Busters
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.83,0:16:42.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哇！帅呆了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.69,0:16:44.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}Busters是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.42,0:16:47.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}意思好像是很厉害的人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.12,0:16:49.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们要保护和平！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.96,0:16:51.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fs36\blur2}好厉害！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.54,0:16:51.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哪里的和平？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.33,0:16:54.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}无论什么地方 各种和平
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.35,0:16:58.57,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哇 那仁太就是头儿咯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.88,0:17:00.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没错
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.32,0:17:04.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家都跟着我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.79,0:17:07.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错 那天
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.41,0:17:10.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是那天
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.97,0:17:15.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}喂 仁太你是不是…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.99,0:17:16.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.42,0:17:20.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你喜欢芽芽吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.12,0:17:27.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你说…说…说什么呀
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.01,0:17:29.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}老实交代吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.10,0:17:32.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}超级和平Busters里 不能有所隐瞒哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.02,0:17:33.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}雪热！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.05,0:17:37.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说吧 说吧 说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.19,0:17:39.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真是的 别这样了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.35,0:17:44.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说 说 说 说
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.46,0:17:46.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谁会喜欢这种丑女…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.29,0:17:52.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以为她会哭
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.11,0:17:55.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为芽芽是爱哭鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.50,0:17:58.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.13,0:18:06.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等 仁太！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.23,0:18:08.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,仁太！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.61,0:18:14.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔 已经回来了呀
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.00,0:18:18.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我到妈妈那里去一下 你把饭热一下再吃哦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.56,0:18:19.48,Title,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs27\frz9.404\pos(925,600)}洗过手然后\N\h\h\h\h热饭吃哦\N\N\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.32,0:18:27.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个笑容 总让我有些担心
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.10,0:18:32.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想着 明天向她道歉好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.38,0:18:34.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真难吃
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.87,0:18:36.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是 那个明天却…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.66,0:18:39.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,永远 不能到来了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.33,0:18:53.24,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,咖喱…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.82,0:18:59.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂 门开了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.70,0:19:00.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就关上呗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.19,0:19:05.86,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,阿聪 长大了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.20,0:19:09.45,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸 长了这么多白头发…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.51,0:19:20.19,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.82,0:19:22.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,适可而止吧 要这样做到什么时候
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.53,0:19:24.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,聪君
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.32,0:19:27.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吃咖喱的时候 总是会给姐姐供上一碗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.20,0:19:29.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有些碍眼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.86,0:19:32.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为这个是姐姐最喜欢吃的呀
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.72,0:19:35.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,死了就吃不了饭了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.04,0:19:37.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别那样说
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.70,0:19:41.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你姐姐她有点脱线
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.99,0:19:45.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说不定都没意识到自己已经死了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.54,0:19:47.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.25,0:19:50.04,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,芽芽
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.04,0:19:53.00,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,自己死了这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.50,0:19:54.57,Meiko,,0000,0000,0000,,还是知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.06,0:19:58.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.77,0:20:00.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不知道啊 杯子自己就…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.19,0:20:03.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fs36}废话少说 赶紧收拾了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.56,0:20:05.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fs36}切 明明不关我的事…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.27,0:20:02.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,芽衣子？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.66,0:20:10.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么都没有 老爸那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.91,0:20:17.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,漂亮的破坏了和平的我们
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.59,0:20:23.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知不觉中 各自离散…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.47,0:20:37.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur2}芽芽喜欢蛋花 蛋花
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.99,0:20:40.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.00,0:20:47.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.36,0:20:50.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想要…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.91,0:20:55.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙 可能会去的地方的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.06,0:21:02.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一直
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.10,0:21:05.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想要到达那天之后的明天
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.32,0:21:10.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想要到达能够向芽芽道歉的明天
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.64,0:21:18.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,芽芽…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.71,0:21:23.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的心理压力
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.85,0:21:27.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的精神创伤
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.16,0:21:38.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对 一定是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.88,0:21:42.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我为了向芽芽道歉才把她召唤出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.65,0:21:45.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果是那样的话 这样下去…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.54,0:22:01.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,芽…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.46,0:22:11.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是…怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.52,0:22:18.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这也太重口味了吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.13,0:22:22.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋！正是在这样的落差里才能体会到浪漫吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.80,0:22:25.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,咦？这不是仁太吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.76,0:22:27.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,波…波？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.25,0:22:31.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那我们把名字刻在这里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.77,0:22:33.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}“超” 怎么写的？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.47,0:22:37.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不知道吗？就是 左边写一个 “走”
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.84,0:22:39.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}“走” 怎么写?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.78,0:22:41.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么在这里？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.19,0:22:48.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那天 在此处停驻的时间之轮 重新转动了起来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.55,0:22:53.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,芽芽的归宿在哪里呢？
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,ー＝＝＝＝＝　ＯＰ　＝＝＝＝＝－
